    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d382-a2">

                <pb facs="0429" n="363" sameAs="frus:frus1934v05/pg363"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 2]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Draft Reply to Letter “B” From the Haitian
                        Government</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: Acting under instructions of my
                    Government, I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt of Your Excellency’s
                    note No. …, dated . . . . . ., enclosing a memorandum setting forth the
                    principal provisions of the fiscal policy which Your Excellency’s <pb
                        facs="0430" n="364" xml:id="pg364"/> Government pledges itself to follow
                    until the complete amortization or prior refunding of the Haitian loan of
                    1922.</p>
                <p>My Government has taken due note of the content of the memorandum in question, an
                    English translation of which is attached hereto.</p>
                <p>Accept, Excellency, etc., etc.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
